me his Georgian opponent " [:a {:href "/athletes/155662"} "Givi Matcharashvili"] " by a fall. After bronze medals in the 2022 and 2023 World championships, and two gold at European Championships, Tazhudinov was by no means an unknown."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Snyder lost somewhat surprisingly in the bronze medal match against unseeded Iranian " [:a {:href "/athletes/155682"} "Amirali Azarpira"] " on points. After Matcharashvili had toppled #1 seed Maqomedov in the semi-final, the latter had to be content with bronze after the Ukrainian " [:a {:href "/athletes/155749"} "Muraz Mchedlidze"] " conceded to the Azerbaijani’s superiority."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Fall", :class "footnote"} "VF"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Technical Superiority", :class "footnote"} "ST"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points", :class "footnote"} "TP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points Received", :class "footnote"} "TPR"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/155623"} "Akhmed Tazhudinov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BRN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BRN.png"}] "BRN"]] [:td {} "15"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "26"] [:td {} "9"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/155662"} "Givi Matcharashvili"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GEO"} [:img {:style "padding-rig